# One line ending everywhere, so a checkout on Windows is byte for byte what CI builds
# and what players install. Without this, git hands Windows CRLF and tools that read a
# file line by line see a stray carriage return at the end of every line.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The built script is what players install; never let anything rewrite it.
dist/** -text
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
